  "description": "MediatorEdge — a lightweight, async-friendly Mediator pattern implementation for .NET. Built for Minimal APIs and CQRS: send requests to a single handler, publish notifications to many, with assembly scanning and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration.",
